    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6622" root="جوب" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَيْبٌ</span></b>  meaning The [<i>part called</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوْق</span> of a
shirt, (see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جيب</span>,) is, accord. to some, from
the root <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جوب</span>, because the middle of it is cut out:
accord. to others, from the root <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جيب</span>. (TA.)

